'''Cargo speeders'''<ref name="SWEDK">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref> were [[repulsorlift]] vehicles designed to transport cargo across the surface of [[planet]]s in a timely manner.<ref name="Part III">{{Kenobi|Part III}}</ref> [[FMR-385 cargo speeder]]s were cargo [[speeder]]s<ref name="SWEDK" /> utilized by the [[Galactic Empire]] on planets like [[Mapuzo]].<ref name="Part III" /> [[Speeder truck]]s were also repulsorlift vehicles that ferried cargo.<ref name="Thrawn">[[Thrawn (novel)|''Thrawn'']]</ref>

